# MyShop AI Operational Boundaries

1. NEVER delete any files or directories in this project.
2. NEVER access or modify any files outside this project directory.
3. NEVER run destructive commands (no `rm`, `del`, `Remove-Item`, `git clean`, `git reset --hard`, `DROP TABLE`).
4. NEVER commit or expose `.env` or sensitive API keys/credentials.
5. All operations and commands must be executed locally within `d:\Personal Project\MyShop`.
